function clarificationAdminHTML(order,kind){const fields=(kind==='bookings'?['name','phone','hotel','date','time','note','manual']:['name','phone','hotel','address','flight','date','time','note','manual']),q=order.clarification;return `<details class="order-clarification-editor" ${order.status==='needs_info'||q?.answeredAt&&order.status==='pending'?'open':''}><summary>Запросить уточнение</summary><label class="field">Какой пункт уточнить<select class="input" data-clarification-field><option value="">Выберите пункт</option>${fields.map(field=>`<option value="${field}" ${q?.field===field?'selected':''}>${orderClarificationLabels[field]}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="field">Вопрос или пояснение<textarea class="input" data-clarification-prompt maxlength="1000" rows="2" placeholder="Для свободного вопроса — обязательно">${esc(q?.prompt||'')}</textarea></label><div class="clarification-latest">${q?.answeredAt?`<p><b>Ответ клиента · ${esc(orderClarificationLabels[q.field]||q.field)}</b><br>${esc(q.answer)}${q.field==='manual'?'':'<br><small>Поле заявки исправлено автоматически.</small>'}</p>`:q?'<p class="hint">Ожидаем ответ пользователя.</p>':''}</div><button class="btn btn-sea small" type="button" data-send-clarification="${esc(order.code)}" data-order-kind="${kind}">Отправить запрос уточнения</button><p class="err" data-clarification-admin-error role="alert"></p></details>`}
